          "en": "as we learn it here with property binding.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.06,
          "end": 23.52,
          "en": "It also means that listening to events",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.52,
          "end": 26.52,
          "en": "is super simple and straightforward.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
