          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 51.3,
          "end": 55.437,
          "en": "And that event emitter could now also transport some data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 55.437,
          "end": 58.56,
          "en": "But here I'll actually add why as a type",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 58.56,
          "end": 61.95,
          "en": "because I won't emit any data. I'll just emit the hate.",
