          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 100.08,
          "end": 103.5,
          "en": "and in there we can now listen to close.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 103.5,
          "end": 106.09,
          "en": "And here we can now call on",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 107.28,
          "end": 111.12,
          "en": "handle error, for example whatever you want to name it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 111.12,
          "end": 114.19,
          "en": "This is a method we now have to add to the off component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 115.59,
          "end": 117.15,
          "en": "maybe here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 117.15,
          "end": 118.86,
          "en": "And in on hand error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 118.86,
          "end": 121.05,
          "en": "I essentially just want to reset the error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 121.05,
          "end": 123.78,
          "en": "So I'll set error back to null.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 123.78,
          "end": 125.88,
          "en": "And by doing that, the condition",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 125.88,
          "end": 128.04,
          "en": "for displaying the error will be removed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 128.04,
          "end": 130.11,
          "en": "because we're using error here in NGF.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 130.11,
          "end": 131.46,
          "en": "And if that is null",
