          "end": 162.72,
          "en": "the imperative approach. You're all going to learn about.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 162.72,
          "end": 166.26,
          "en": "Using this approach with NGF is so much easier",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 166.26,
          "end": 168.75,
          "en": "and they offer really is an approach you should",
